<li>
<title>transition matrix</title>
<idx><h>transition matrix</h></idx>
<idx><h>matrix</h><h>transition</h></idx>
<p> an invertible matrix <m>P</m> that realizes a similarity relationship <m>B = \inv{P} A P</m> for similar matrices <m>A</m> and <m>B</m> </p>
</li>
